      "value": "@{5fb74a89aa70e657a51fa62e|full_name}: Preferably a one time purchase if money needs to be involved that gives a badge of some sort saying 18+ on your profile that then leads to the things I mentioned above. I would personally not want to have a subscription based fee for it or let alone money involved at all but that would be a developer decision, so if they go the purchase route I would want something affordable, I’m hoping maybe 10-20 dollars USD, one time purchase. I really do not want a subscription for 18+ just the one time verification.\n\nIf your ever dabbled in playing IMVU, they have a purchasable AP (adult pass) that you have to provide your ID upon purchase, so that sort of thing.\n\nI know that there will be some individuals that will try and “verify” their 18+ pass using their parent / relative’s / guardian’s ID and debit card, and that should be reportable. It shouldn’t lead to a permanent ban but perhaps a lengthy temp ban and their 18+ pass revoked.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
