      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The idea is a solid one, the main issue I would think about is the security risk. Say VRChat does take this route, they now have to manage real ID's which can be dangerous if VRChat is hacked. \n\nPurchases we make are done through steam, so VRChat doesn't have worry about that info getting out. So the best option I would take is the purchasable badge. It might also incentivize ban evaders to be nicer to people as they would have to drop another $20 to play VRChat with an adult pass.\n\nSo the purchasable adult pass idea I like. $15 is affordable for anyone. An hour of work for most? I'd stay away from the real ID's",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
