      "value": "@{5cc8ef132dfd030ccc7c49c3|full_name}: I agree. However it’s done it should be done in a way where the potential for the ID’s can’t be seen by just anybody, I wouldn’t mind spending the money either. I would be more for doing a one time payment for an 18+ badge that allows access to 18+ hangouts, events, whatever it may be. But I’m really not for a subscription based thing and would like to veer away from that; especially since I believe there’s already a subscription program for certain membership benefits. The one time purchase for an 18+ pass just makes sense.",
